        "created_at": "2017-01-06T13:26:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>They haven't been working since at least March of last year, (that's when I conversed with CaunJoel about it) and I'm absolutely certain it was not functioning much longer than that.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I have definitely gotten many e-mails about PMs more recently than that, throughout all of last fall. I'm not aware of missing any messages in that time.</p>\n<p>Is it perhaps an e-mail spam-blocking thing? For instance, did the &gt;G servers end up on some blacklist? That would cause messages to silently disappear without showing up in a spam folder.</p>",
