        "raw": "[quote=\"Matchstickman\"]\n They haven&#39;t been working since at least March of last year, (that&#39;s when I conversed with CaunJoel about it) and I&#39;m absolutely certain it was not functioning much longer than that.  \n[/quote]\nI have definitely gotten many e-mails about PMs more recently than that, throughout all of last fall. I&#39;m not aware of missing any messages in that time. \n\n Is it perhaps an e-mail spam-blocking thing? For instance, did the &gt;G servers end up on some blacklist? That would cause messages to silently disappear without showing up in a spam folder. \n",
